      "writtenOn": "2023-11-03T17:04:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The idea is that in a future CL `setLabel` will call a virtual `onSetLabel`. This virtual call will allow a backend to set a label directly on a real GPU object (e.g. see VK_EXT_debug_utils). If we didn\u0027t use `setLabel` here then the backend would need to manually call its special label API after creating the Resource. This just keeps all the calls to putting labels in one place.",
      "parentUuid": "2aca0b0c_c6a48e88",
